High Level Steps


Step 1 — Prepare Your Data (RAG)

Collect documents (PDFs, workflows, logs, procedures, notes)

Store them in a vector database (Chroma, Pinecone, BigQuery Vector)

Step 2 — Build the Agent Logic

Use LangChain / Agent framework

Define tools (GitHub trigger, Slack notify, BigQuery query, etc.)

Configure Gemini Flash / Pro as the LLM

Step 3 — Develop the Agent API

Create a FastAPI backend

Build a /agent endpoint

Accept prompts and return LLM responses

Integrate RAG + tools

Step 4 — Containerize the Agent

Build a Docker image

Push to Artifact Registry

Step 5 — Deploy the Agent

Deploy to Cloud Run

Attach service account

Add environment variables & secrets

Test using CURL/UI
